version	2.2.0
base	20.5.0-ams-1.10.1
channel	preview
note	Meridian redesigns Homebrew, System, Updater and the version guide with a mint and cobalt identity.
note	With the Windows installer, Nintendo HOME gains a gallery layout, three toolbar groups and nine new icons.
note	Settings, News and All Software use their native screens with Meridian styling when resources are available.
note	Meridian boot artwork is available in Hekate. Windows also installs the custom Atmosphere splash framebuffer.
